1
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:08,940
=Blossoms of Power=
(Adapted from the Qidian novel After My Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

2
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:11,900
=Special Episode=

3
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,439
Mencius once said,

4
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,760
"The people are most important.

5
00:00:16,239 --> 00:00:17,440
The state comes next.

6
00:00:18,039 --> 00:00:19,039
The ruler matters least.

7
00:00:19,839 --> 00:00:22,920
Thus, one who wins the people's
support becomes the Son of Heaven."

8
00:00:23,239 --> 00:00:24,359
This means

9
00:00:25,079 --> 00:00:26,239
that governing the realm

10
00:00:26,839 --> 00:00:28,239
requires putting the people first.

11
00:00:39,079 --> 00:00:39,640
Your Majesty.

12
00:00:42,119 --> 00:00:42,679
Your Majesty.

13
00:00:48,759 --> 00:00:50,200
I lost focus.

14
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:51,960
Please punish me, Grand Tutor.

15
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,079
Is something troubling Your Majesty?

16
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:01,439
I haven't seen Mother in days.

17
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,280
If Your Majesty wishes
to see the Empress Dowager,

18
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:06,840
I can grant you a day's leave.

19
00:01:16,719 --> 00:01:17,640
Grand Tutor.

20
00:01:18,159 --> 00:01:19,760
Father is back.

21
00:01:19,959 --> 00:01:22,439
Mother seems to have
completely forgotten about me.

22
00:01:24,079 --> 00:01:24,799
Yunhuai.

23
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,120
Has His Highness

24
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:27,079
finally recovered?

25
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,879
I have found

26
00:01:28,879 --> 00:01:30,800
an antidote for the poison
from the Western Regions.

27
00:01:30,810 --> 00:01:32,140
Once the poison is completely purged,

28
00:01:32,159 --> 00:01:34,680
the victim's health and lifespan

29
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,730
will be no different from anyone else's.

30
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,879
However, His Highness
was poisoned for too long,

31
00:01:38,959 --> 00:01:40,170
which damaged his internal organs.

32
00:01:40,599 --> 00:01:41,879
He will need long-term care

33
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,120
to make a full recovery.

34
00:01:43,879 --> 00:01:45,879
I have compiled the antidote method

35
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:48,680
and the many precious prescriptions
I've gathered over the years

36
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,519
into a book.

37
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,200
As long as Your Majesty
has someone follow these prescriptions,

38
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,750
His Highness will make a full recovery.

39
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,799
Although the poison has been cured,

40
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,640
I still had the imperial physician

41
00:02:04,660 --> 00:02:06,200
prepare this restorative prescription.

42
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:11,840
Here.

43
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,680
There's no need for all this trouble.

44
00:02:19,159 --> 00:02:20,800
You are my miracle cure.

45
00:02:23,210 --> 00:02:25,319
I should have asked Yunhuai
for another prescription

46
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:27,400
to cure your smooth-talking ways.

47
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,680
If I hadn't held on to
the thought of you,

48
00:02:30,700 --> 00:02:32,280
I don't think
I could have made it this far.

49
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:35,080
No matter what happens from now on,

50
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,759
let us never be separated again.

51
00:02:37,639 --> 00:02:38,159
All right.

52
00:02:45,210 --> 00:02:46,400
Report to the Empress Dowager.

53
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,990
His Majesty injured his arm
while practicing swordsmanship.

54
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,039
Take me to him at once.

55
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:49,960
I'll go with you.

56
00:02:54,199 --> 00:02:56,280
Greetings, Mother.

57
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,159
Let me take a look.

58
00:02:58,319 --> 00:02:59,319
Where are you hurt?

59
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,919
It's such a serious wound.

60
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:05,719
Why is it still bleeding?

61
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,159
Didn't the Imperial Medical Office
dress it properly?

62
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:10,680
Mother, I'm perfectly fine.

63
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:12,479
It will heal in a few days.

64
00:03:13,479 --> 00:03:14,479
Does it hurt?

65
00:03:14,879 --> 00:03:15,520
No.

66
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,400
This is all my fault.

67
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,280
I've neglected you these past few days.

68
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,719
It's my fault
for not being more understanding.

69
00:03:24,319 --> 00:03:26,639
My Little Goldfish
is always so thoughtful.

70
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Little Goldfish,

71
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,639
your father cares
about you very much too.

72
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,479
Father.

73
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:44,400
Ouch!

74
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,439
Let me see.

75
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,960
Did you get hurt?

76
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:50,919
Mother, don't blame Father.

77
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,960
Uncle always catches me.

78
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,719
I thought Father would too.

79
00:04:00,159 --> 00:04:00,960
Excellent.

80
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,120
You truly are my son.

81
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:06,080
You've inherited the very best of me.

82
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:09,360
You've served your father
quite a strong cup of Wuyang tea.

83
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,080
Little Goldfish,

84
00:04:13,759 --> 00:04:16,279
you've spent
much more time with your uncle,

85
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:18,130
so it's only natural
that you understand each other.

86
00:04:18,439 --> 00:04:21,079
Once you've spent
more time with your father,

87
00:04:21,439 --> 00:04:22,519
it will be the same.

88
00:04:22,839 --> 00:04:24,800
Mother is right.

89
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,800
Father, why aren't you saying anything?

90
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,519
Father, are you angry?

91
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:33,079
Or do you not like me?

92
00:04:37,319 --> 00:04:38,439
I have

93
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,800
a gift for you.

94
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:41,240
It's four years late.

95
00:04:42,079 --> 00:04:43,560
I hope Little Goldfish won't mind.

96
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:48,759
Little Goldfish.

97
00:04:48,770 --> 00:04:49,360
It's all right.

98
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:51,399
Let him have a moment to himself.

99
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:57,279
He must feel too ashamed to face us

100
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,680
after his little scheme

101
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,759
was seen through.

102
00:05:01,879 --> 00:05:02,959
You figured it out?

103
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,480
He's exactly like you.

104
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,439
I was never there for him.

105
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:13,399
Expecting him to accept me right away

106
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:15,000
is asking too much of him.

107
00:05:16,279 --> 00:05:17,160
But don't worry.

108
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,040
By tomorrow,

109
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,560
I'll make sure he accepts me.

110
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,319
What are you planning to do?

111
00:05:25,519 --> 00:05:26,519
Just trust me.

112
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,439
Is something bothering you?

113
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,399
Can you tell me about it?

114
00:06:22,639 --> 00:06:23,959
Would you really care?

115
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:29,040
Of course I would.

116
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:32,879
Little Goldfish.

117
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,639
You are the child your mother
and I brought into this world.

118
00:06:36,199 --> 00:06:37,839
You carry on our bloodline,

119
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,839
and you are the proof of our love.

120
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,319
Your happiness, your sadness,

121
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:44,680
your every move,

122
00:06:45,319 --> 00:06:47,279
all weigh on
your mother's heart and mine.

123
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:51,720
Father was never by my side
when I was little.

124
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:53,920
I always hoped that one day,

125
00:06:54,079 --> 00:06:57,160
Father would suddenly appear before me.

126
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,199
But that wish

127
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,680
never came true.

128
00:07:03,199 --> 00:07:04,600
I only had Mother.

129
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,879
But now,

130
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:09,199
it feels like ever since
Father came back,

131
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:13,120
Mother doesn't devote
all her attention to me anymore.

132
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:14,759
Is it wrong

133
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:16,319
for me to think that?

134
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,800
I didn't come back

135
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:34,879
to take your mother away.

136
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,360
I came back to be with both of you.

137
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,040
Father.

138
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:48,120
Father, how did you find me?

139
00:07:53,759 --> 00:07:55,560
When I was unhappy,

140
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,520
I used to come here too.

141
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:11,720
After Hou Yi shot down
the other nine suns,

142
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,439
naturally only one remained.

143
00:08:16,279 --> 00:08:18,439
Father, what happened after that?

144
00:08:20,519 --> 00:08:21,680
Little by little,

145
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:23,800
the scorched forests

146
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:26,680
came back to life as life-giving rain
fell from the heavens,

147
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:28,800
nourishing the crops and the trees.

148
00:08:30,439 --> 00:08:31,560
Between heaven and earth,

149
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,120
only one sun remained,

150
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,720
and the world became what it is today.

151
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,600
Then what happened to Hou Yi?

152
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:39,519
He shot down all those suns.

153
00:08:39,879 --> 00:08:41,039
Did everyone under heaven

154
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:42,879
admire him

155
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,559
and make him their king?

156
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,159
In the end, Hou Yi

157
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:52,720
chose to live among the common people,

158
00:08:53,759 --> 00:08:54,919
caring for their hardships

159
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:56,440
and helping those in need.

160
00:08:57,519 --> 00:08:59,759
Isn't that a pity?

161
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,480
Perhaps Hou Yi

162
00:09:05,159 --> 00:09:06,519
never cared for power.

163
00:09:07,559 --> 00:09:09,360
All he wanted
was peace throughout the realm

164
00:09:10,260 --> 00:09:11,399
and happiness for the people.

165
00:09:57,559 --> 00:09:59,200
Riddle game!

166
00:09:59,639 --> 00:10:02,480
Solve a riddle and win a goldfish!

167
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:04,840
Goldfish.

168
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:07,679
Solve a riddle and win a goldfish!

169
00:10:08,039 --> 00:10:10,440
Solve a riddle and win a goldfish!

170
00:10:14,799 --> 00:10:15,840
Father, Mother,

171
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,200
let's solve the riddles.

172
00:10:19,759 --> 00:10:21,320
A mouth hides beside the field.

173
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:23,159
A lone stalk leans against the mountain.

174
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:24,879
Three horizontal lines fill the granary.

175
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,879
Two feet tread across the fields.

176
00:10:27,559 --> 00:10:28,799
I know this one.

177
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,960
A bountiful harvest.

178
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,360
Exactly!

179
00:10:34,519 --> 00:10:36,879
Young Master, you are truly clever.

180
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:41,879
Just as expected of Mother's son.

181
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:44,080
Back then, your mother
was just as unbeatable

182
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,639
at solving riddles.

183
00:10:46,519 --> 00:10:47,399
Another one.

184
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:55,559
A mouth holds the moon,
hearts forever entwined.

185
00:10:56,159 --> 00:10:58,480
Three strokes and a hook,
never to be apart.

186
00:10:58,679 --> 00:11:01,159
Silken threads wind through
the carriage in endless knots.

187
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:03,879
Twin branches rest together in the rain.

188
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,519
Youyou, do you know the answer?

189
00:11:14,919 --> 00:11:16,960
Is it Forever United,
Like Intertwined Branches?

190
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,039
Madam,

191
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:20,200
you truly are gifted
with exceptional wit.

192
00:11:20,799 --> 00:11:22,159
I think this little goldfish

193
00:11:22,159 --> 00:11:23,840
should go to your young master.

194
00:11:29,759 --> 00:11:30,720
Young Master,

195
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,279
here, take it.

196
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,159
Mother,

197
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:39,200
what does "Forever United,
Like Intertwined Branches" mean?

198
00:11:42,679 --> 00:11:43,840
It means

199
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:46,330
Father and Mother will always
stay with Little Goldfish,

200
00:11:46,530 --> 00:11:48,360
and together we'll watch
our magnificent land

201
00:11:48,519 --> 00:11:49,559
prosper for all eternity.

202
00:11:54,399 --> 00:11:55,639
Let's go look over there.

203
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:56,480
All right.

204
00:11:59,060 --> 00:12:03,460
♪Only the threads of love are exquisite♪

205
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:07,260
♪Hidden in the depths of your eyes♪

206
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:11,980
♪An autumn lake reflects you and I♪

207
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:14,780
♪As the years go by♪

208
00:12:14,780 --> 00:12:18,780
♪My heart rises and falls♪

209
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:22,700
♪A pool of you♪

210
00:12:27,980 --> 00:12:35,140
♪And a pool of me♪
